#ntdiff PUBLIC/OAK/BIN/REGISTRY.INI
#crlf
=1 1 11
+// The R3000 port (the DECstation 5000/200): no network yet, and the        //
+// Password logs the first run on by itself.                                //
=1 14 4
=1 30 10
=1 50 8
+    DECSTATION
=1 74 9
+    Developer
+
+;
+;  The R3000 port: the password of that account.  The first run creates the
+;  account with it and logs on to it by itself (winlogon.cmd sets
+;  AutoAdminLogon and DefaultPassword); without a password winlogon.cmd
+;  waits for a key.
+;
+
+Password
+    nt35
=1 84 6
+
+Environment
+    tmp = c:\tmp
=1 183 14
=1 221 37
=1 424 21
+;  The R3000 port: the LSA's developer install (DBINSTAL.C) needs both
+;  (without DomainId it sets no account domain and SAM fails with
+;  STATUS_INVALID_SID).  No network yet, so DisablePasswordChange (a
+;  value of Netlogon, which the hive does not have) is left out.
=1 444 21
